# Example environment variables for asifurrahaman-site.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. Never commit the real `.env`.
#
# This is a statically generated site and currently needs NO secrets to build.
# The variables below are placeholders for optional future integrations.
# Anything exposed to client-side code MUST be prefixed with PUBLIC_.

# Example: analytics or form-handling endpoint (optional, future use)
# PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=
# CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
